\",\\n      \\\"no_progress_policy_ref\\\": \\\"policy-id/version\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"proposed|ready|running|waiting|paused|blocked|review|completed|cancelled|expired\\\",\\n      \\\"evidence_refs\\\": []\\n  }\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n8. Side-effect Ledger 契约\\n  {\\n      \\\"effect_id\\\": \\\"uuid\\\",\\n      \\\"task_id\\\": \\\"uuid\\\",\\n      \\\"run_id\\\": \\\"uuid\\\",\\n      \\\"tool_id\\\": \\\"stable-name\\\",\\n      \\\"idempotency_key\\\": \\\"stable-key\\\",\\n      \\\"effect_summary\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"planned|submitted|confirmed|failed|unknown|compensated\\\",\\n      \\\"external_receipt_ref\\\": \\\"optional\\\",\\n      \\\"last_reconciled_at\\\": \\\"RFC3339-or-null\\\"\\n  }\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n9. 同步回执\\n服务端回执必须包括 batch_id、已持久化的 event IDs 或可验证连续范围、未确认/拒绝事件及原因、服务端持久化时间和协议\\n版本。HTTP 成功或连接成功本身不等于同步成功。\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n10. 错误返回\\n统一错误对象至少包含 error_code、message、retryable、correlation_id、related_event_id、required_action 和\\nsafe_to_repeat。safe_to_repeat=unknown 时必须先对账或人工确认。\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n11. 版本兼容\\n能力发布必须声明最低 App 版本、工具契约、权限要求、数据 Schema、模型能力要求、离线支持和回滚目标。缺失兼容声明的\\n制品不得进入稳定通道。\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n                                                       EvoAgent｜全量详细设计正式版 1.0\"}],\"ref_id\":\"turn22file2\"}],\"next_cursor\":null,\"warnings\":[]}"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"invoked_plugin":{},"invoked_resource":{"resource_uri":"/files/search","publish_status":"published","api_tool_version":"v2","contains_mcp_source":false,"description":"Search conversation uploads, Project files, Project knowledge, and allowed Library files with ranked semantic search. Project-backed files stay on scope.surfaces=['conversation'] and report source_kind='project'; use scope.surfaces=['library'] only for allowed Library search. Indexed connector-synced Project docs may appear as Project file results. For current Drive bytes, downloads, or exports, use an available live Google Drive connector with a user-sup